WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.360
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:13.700
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:17.330
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.830
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.420
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:29.050
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.680
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.310
by ridding you...

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:43.480
...of your other love?

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:48.060
At sunset,

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.570
when the children go home,

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.490
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:58.410
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:00.490
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:04.290
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:11.800
In a city without light,

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.350
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:24.850
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:32.150 --> 00:01:36.150
I'm Kurata Sana,
a 6th grader and TV personality.

00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:39.490
My Aoki award-winning novelist Mama,
and her chipmunk, Maro-chan.

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:43.490
My chauffeur, manager,
and ex-pimp, Rei-kun.

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:45.830
The mysterious white bat
straight man, Babbit.

00:01:45.830 --> 00:01:47.830
Have you heard the new ending?

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:51.790
Hayama Akito, my natural enemy
and good friend, I suppose.

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:03.850
The Kurata household... has gone bankrupt.

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:09.520
We're raking it in just by being alive.

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:13.860
What do you mean, you're canceling again!?

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:15.860
This can't be possible...

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:18.240
Sana-chan doesn't have any work?

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:23.530
"He Got Me Blacklisted"

00:02:23.530 --> 00:02:24.540
I've been waiting for this!

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:26.540
Wow! Bentos! Bentos!

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:28.710
"I humbly accept this meal!"

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:32.130
Delicious, delicious!

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:35.000
--The commercial for Odabutsu Screamland...
--Channel 108's bentos are the best!

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:36.050
--Pearl Eyedrops...
--Wow, there's so much!

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:37.800
--the commercial for Happy Life...
--I haven't had this side dish
in a long time! Fried shrimp!

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:38.840
--They've all been called off.
--I haven't had this side dish
in a long time! Fried shrimp!

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:40.180
--They've all been called off.
--I didn't think I'd ever get to eat this

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:42.140
--The variety specials were all
suddenly cancelled, too,
--for the rest of my life!

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:43.930
and the talks for her appearance

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:46.810
in that spring serial drama
that they were so eager about-

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:49.480
why are they canceling now?

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:53.860
Ah, what on earth am I supposed to do?

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:55.820
Rei-kun, the tea, the tea!

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:57.190
I spy something yummy!

00:02:57.190 --> 00:02:58.190
It's mine now!

00:02:58.190 --> 00:03:00.860
Ah! You stole my omelet roll!

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:03.160
I was saving it to eat last!

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:06.540
Hey, give it back!
Give me back my omelet roll!

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:07.830
I've already eaten it!

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:09.500
And you call yourself a mother!? Hey!

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:13.170
Survival of the fittest!
It's either eat or be eaten in this life!

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:14.170
Now you've done it!

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:15.550
I did it, all right!

00:03:15.550 --> 00:03:16.840
Hey, wait up!

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:17.840
No way!

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:19.220
Give me back my omelet roll!

00:03:19.220 --> 00:03:20.220
Nothing doing!

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:22.180
Give me back my omelet roll!

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:22.180
"Rei-kun is steadfast"

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:27.850
Um, Sana-chan, about working, I was
wondering what you wanted to do now...

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:32.020
Well, things will turn out fine. For now,
I'll still stick with "Child's Toy."

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:33.020
Oh, that's right!

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:34.650
Beginning tomorrow, we're doing
our first overseas location shoot!

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:36.480
"Child's Toy in Hawaii!"

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:38.740
On location in exciting,
heart-pounding, "Wa-haii"!

00:03:38.740 --> 00:03:42.160
My school swimsuit might
be pretty fashionable to wear.

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:46.160
Well, you see, actually,
that was cancelled, too.

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:48.830
What? What? I didn't hear that.

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:50.500
Mama, did you just say something?

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:52.830
No, she didn't!

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:54.500
Did somebody say something?

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.840
Really, stop playing dumb!

00:03:56.840 --> 00:04:00.840
You alone were cancelled from
the Hawaii location shoot, Sana-chan.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:03.010
You're kidding!

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:04.840
"Are you serious?"

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:04.890
Why!? Why did that happen!?

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:08.850
Huh? Sana-chan?

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:09.850
Good morning...

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:13.520
What's the matter? Weren't you supposed
to be on location in Hawaii starting today?

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:16.270
You said you'd be taking about a week off
because you were going to Hawaii,

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:17.190
didn't you?

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:19.070
"Yadda yadda and such and such"

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:19.190
Actually...

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:21.860
Huh? All of your work has been cancelled?

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:23.450
That's right.

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:27.120
Hold on, you're just eating
to feel better, huh?

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:30.120
Sana-chan, is it true that you also
lost your job on "Child's Toy"?

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:31.790
That's right.

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:34.460
Sana-chan, you're having
some bad luck, huh?

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:38.460
Do you have any idea why?

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:39.460
Nope.

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:41.460
Nope?

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:43.970
Put your hand over your heart
and think hard.

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:47.800
Sure enough, nope.

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:50.600
Is she really thinking about it?

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:52.640
"Meanwhile, Rei-kun..."

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:56.100
Hello? Please, tell me the reason why!

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:58.480
Why did you suddenly
cancel only Sana-chan!?

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:02.150
Please, wait! I need
a clearer reason than-

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:04.450
Hello!? Hello!?

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:10.490
There's something strange going on.

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:12.620
Whenever I ask about the reasons
for the cancellations,

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:14.500
everyone gives ambiguous answers.

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:18.170
Whatever it is, I have to find out
what's going on, or else...

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:21.500
Huh? Aren't you that producer... um?

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:22.840
S- Sagami-san!

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:27.470
Ta-san! No... Chi-san! No... Tsu-san!

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:31.140
That's it! Tsu-san! Tsu-san!
This is perfect!

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:34.140
As it happens, there's something
I'd like to ask you about Sana-chan!

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:39.150
Um... l- I have to hurry home
and flip the switch on my rice cooker...

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:40.820
I'm terribly sorry, Sagami-san!

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:43.820
Ah! You can't avoid me!
Now, please, tell me!

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:47.490
Why are only Sana-chan's
appearances being cancelled!?

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:52.490
Sagami-san! Don't ask me anything
right now! I can't say anything!

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:55.500
Don't tell me that!

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:58.170
Please wait! Tsu-san!

00:05:58.170 --> 00:06:01.500
Aw, he's gone. What was
he so agitated about?

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:03.750
Sagami-san, isn't it?

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:10.180
Oh, I know that ugly costume of yours!
You're that guy from before!

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:11.220
"Who is this guy?"

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:15.180
Actually, this is who I am.

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:19.520
"Dreaming Productions, secretary to
the president, Akudoi Zo" ("I'm crooked")

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:23.520
No, no, the name is Akudo lzo.

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:26.780
Dreaming Pro?

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:29.910
Um, what would someone from
Dreaming Pro, the top firm in the industry,

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:31.450
want with me?

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:34.120
Let me come right to the point.

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:38.790
We would very much like Kurata Sana-chan
to join our production firm.

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:43.130
But Sana-chan's policy is not to be
affiliated with any production studio.

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:46.130
Mm-hmm, I am well aware of that.

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:50.470
However, the situation is a little bit
different now, is it not?

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:54.140
It would appear that currently,
Sana-chan does not have any work.

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:56.470
If that keeps up, then the talents that
Sana-chan has worked so hard to build up

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:57.480
will fall out of the public eye,

00:06:57.480 --> 00:07:00.520
and you will be unable to put
your skills as her manager to work,

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:02.480
and you will be through.

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:04.820
What do you say, Sagami-san?

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:09.820
For the sake of Sana-chan's future,
would you be the one to suggest it to her?

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:13.160
We would pay her exceptionally well.

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:16.490
Huh? Exceptionally well?

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:19.160
No, I, Sagami will not be swayed by that.

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:25.540
As Sana-chan's manager, I believe I will
continue to respect her policy, and so...

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:27.840
...goodbye.

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:33.140
I doubt you're going to find work so easily.

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:34.930
"Suspicious fellow"

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:34.930
Who are you?

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:40.480
Dreaming Pro, huh? I turned them down
all on my own, but I almost wish I hadn't.

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:46.820
After all, they could probably market
Sana-chan on a larger scale, and all...

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:50.490
No, stop that. What good will it do
to get all pessimistic?

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:53.780
Now then, to get home
before the trains get crowded.

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:58.790
I wonder if we should have
croquette patties for dinner...

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:03.790
Huh? Is that Tsu-san with
Dreaming Pro's Akudo?

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:07.550
I wonder what they're talking about.
They seem to be on fairly good terms.

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:13.180
Excuse me for saying so,
but it would appear that currently,

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:15.470
Sana-chan has absolutely no work.

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:19.770
He wouldn't have... Then again,
it just might be possible...

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:24.190
Sagami-san!

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:27.860
Tsu-san, you just met with Akudo-san
from Dreaming Pro, didn't you!?

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:29.780
What were you talking about!?

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:33.780
N- nothing at all, really! We were
just having a little dinner together!

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:37.780
You're lying to me. You were going
to cook dinner at home, weren't you?

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:41.370
"Tsu-san dug his own boketsu"

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:41.370
Boketsu" means the hole for a grave.

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:46.790
Look, Tsu-san, tell me, I'm begging you!
I won't tell anyone I heard it from you.

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:49.170
--Our relationship is better than that, right?
--What kind of relationship
do they have, exactly?

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:50.380
--Right? Right?
--What kind of relationship
do they have, exactly?

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:51.460
Ew, yuck!

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:53.800
They did what!?

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:57.470
I knew it! So this is
Dreaming Pro's doing, is it!?

00:08:57.470 --> 00:09:01.810
Sagami-san, please,
don't tell anyone I told you!

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:02.810
They won't get away with it!

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:04.480
Ah! Well, bye now!

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:09.150
--Using underhanded tricks to take away
Sana-chan's work to get her to join them?
--Now, now, easy, easy...

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:12.150
How crooked those guys are!

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:15.490
At this point, just you watch,
I'm going to protect Sana-chan.

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:19.160
I'm not about to be beaten
by those guys! Then again...

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:18.570
"I'm the greatest manager in all Japan!!"

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:22.830
...what am I supposed to do against
a production company that big?

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:24.250
"Worried, worried Rei-kun"

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:29.090
Oh yeah, I have to buy some
croquettes on the way home.

00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:30.840
--Seconds!
--Seconds!

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:35.470
--I said, seconds!
--I said, seconds!

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:39.100
--Seconds!
--Seconds!

00:09:39.100 --> 00:09:42.100
Sorry, there's no more rice.

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:45.100
Huh? It's empty.

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:48.100
You sure do eat a lot for someone
not bringing any money in.

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:51.770
You too, Mama- eating up the food
your cute growing daughter needs...

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:56.110
Ah... don't fight. If you want,
the two of you can eat my croquette.

00:09:56.110 --> 00:10:01.080
Okay? I'd like to be alone for
a little while, so if you'll excuse me...

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:11.460
Rei-kun! Hey, Rei-kun!
What's with the stingy snail attitude!?

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:13.800
Open up, Rei-kun! Rei-kun, I say!

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:16.470
Rei-kun, with that kind of attitude,

00:10:16.470 --> 00:10:18.590
the bare bulb will just glare brightly,

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:20.470
as we munch on nothing
but straight cabbage!

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:23.470
All right, times like this
call for... this!

00:10:23.470 --> 00:10:34.440
"The Narrow Path of Enka"

00:10:23.470 --> 00:10:25.810
The song accompanies the world,
and the world accompanies the song,

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:29.770
as the melody of Enka music quietly
pervades the hearts of the Japanese.

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:35.320
Now, let's enjoy the song, "The Secret
Meeting at White Chrysanthemum Manor"!

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:42.450
♪ When I knit this sweater for you, ♪

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:48.460
♪ I forgot the opening
you put your head through. ♪

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:53.460
♪ Ah, such is our secret meeting ♪

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:58.800
♪ at White Chrysanthemum Manor. ♪

00:10:58.800 --> 00:11:01.090
You're the most dismal of any of us!

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:06.810
Rei-kun, it's morning! Let's eat!

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:09.140
"I humbly accept this meal!"

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:13.810
Hey, Rei-kun! I made a whole bunch of rice!

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:14.820
Rei-kun...

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:16.320
Is this Rei-kun's bowl?

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:17.690
"What's wrong with you, Rei-kun?"

00:11:18.490 --> 00:11:22.410
Rei-kun has been acting strange since
last night. I wonder if something happened.

00:11:23.490 --> 00:11:25.490
Oh, Sana-chan...

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:29.160
Cheer up, Sana-chan.
Something good will happen soon.

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:31.830
That's right. No gain, no pain.

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:34.840
Oh, that's not right. No pain, no gain!

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:39.510
Oh, no, it's not like that. I was
thinking about something else.

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:42.510
Say, have you found any work?

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:43.840
--No, huh?
--No, huh?

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:48.850
What are you going to do
if you don't get any work?

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:51.850
Well, if that happens, I'll be fine with it.

00:11:51.850 --> 00:11:54.980
Sure you will! Sana-chan,
you were never that positive

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:56.860
toward taking on work to begin with, right?

00:11:56.860 --> 00:12:00.860
Right, right! You could always go back
to being a regular grade-schooler.

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:03.200
Are you sure you're okay with that?

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:06.530
Mm-hmm, I'm okay with that.

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:09.870
Bye! I've got some shopping to do,
so I'm leaving.

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:12.960
Ta-lee-la-lee-la, que sera sera!

00:12:14.210 --> 00:12:16.880
Let's la-go go! Let's la-go!

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:19.550
Yesterday was croquettes,
today is croquettes,

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:22.220
tomorrow will probably be croquettes too!

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:24.890
Ma'am, three croquettes, please!

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:27.140
Three, okay? Three.

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:29.810
Kurata Sana-chan, right?

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:33.140
Yes, that's right.

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:37.480
My name is Akudo, from Dreaming Pro,
and I'd like you to come with me,

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:40.440
so we can discuss your work.

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:46.490
"Sana-chan's drawing song"

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:44.910
I know this is sudden, but here's
a Sana-chan drawing song.

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:46.490
Get your paper and crayon ready!

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:48.490
First there comes a mountain, and then,

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:50.490
water comes splashing down from it.

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:52.500
Get two cups ready,

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:54.830
and then add two handles.

00:12:54.830 --> 00:12:56.830
Butterflies come flying in,

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:58.840
with tails growing out of their behinds.

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:00.840
Here a slope, there a slope, ups-a-daisy,

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:02.840
and draw in the eye like an arrow.

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:04.840
Let's draw one more arrow.

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:07.180
It's time for gym, so bring
out the vaulting boxes.

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:09.180
Stick a second one on top of it,

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:11.180
The letter "ku," the letter "ku,"
the letter "ku," hey!

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:13.180
Then we stick six beans on.

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:15.190
And now we've drawn Sana-chan!

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:17.520
Dance! Dance! Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:21.030
This is the Sana-chan drawing song!

00:13:22.650 --> 00:13:25.360
Lasso, lasso.

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:33.910
"Babbit's drawing song"

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:30.120
Rice cake, bump, bump,
line, line, triangle,

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:31.950
raindrop with a heart in it,
draw the wings,

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:33.410
and it's Babbit!

00:13:34.120 --> 00:13:37.790
Sana-chan, this is our company president.

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:39.790
Hey, Sana-chan, welcome.

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:42.710
You're not a kid... are you?

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:48.550
You always say such stinging things
like it was nothing, huh Sana-chan?

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:50.140
That's what I like about you.

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:53.810
--Aw, thank you!
--He's angry!

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:55.480
Welcome to our offices.

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:56.810
Oh, thank you.

00:13:56.810 --> 00:14:00.480
Anyhow, Sana-chan, about
what we discussed earlier...

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:02.820
What do you mean,
what we discussed earlier?

00:14:02.820 --> 00:14:05.570
Remember, about a month ago,
we met, right?

00:14:05.570 --> 00:14:07.490
When you were recording "Child's Toy"?

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:10.820
"Child's Toy"? Ah, now that you mention it,

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:14.500
I remember seeing
that lame necktie before...

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:16.830
Waah! Dosukoi! Dosukoi! Dosukoi! Dosukoi!

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:20.830
Ah, did I run into something? I can't
see in front of me, and all, dosukoi!

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:25.840
You're Kurata Sana-chan, right?
It's an honor to meet you here.

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:28.840
This is who I am.

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:33.760
Huh? "Dreaming Pro"? President,
Yumezono Matata-ta-ta-ta-ta

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:35.770
You stop after "Matata"!

00:14:35.770 --> 00:14:37.810
Listen, Sana-chan,

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:41.020
you know that I run the biggest
entertainment production company

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:42.110
in the business, right?

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:45.150
What do you say, Sana-chan,
won't you join us?

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:48.450
A talent like yours should be abundantly
put on display by a bigger outfit,

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:49.450
such as ours.

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:52.780
In both movies and theatre, we have
more work on a larger scale than-

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:55.160
No thanks.

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:57.450
Hey, Sana-chan! They're just
about ready to start!

00:14:57.450 --> 00:14:58.460
Right!

00:14:58.460 --> 00:14:59.830
Well, sorry!

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:01.830
Rei-kun! Rei-kun! Look! Look!

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:06.170
--Sana-chan can do even this!
--I want you. Now I want you
like mad, Sana-chan...

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:10.840
A-ha, is that right? So you are the man from
back then, huh? You'll have to excuse me.

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:13.800
Well? Sana-chan, have you
changed your mind since then?

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:16.470
No, not one bit. I'm satisfied with Rei-kun.

00:15:16.470 --> 00:15:20.850
He's handsome, and nice, and has
outstanding taste in sunglasses.

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:22.810
Not like those lame panda glasses.

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:25.520
P- panda glasses?

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:29.860
Anyhow, I'm fine the way I am now,
so I'm sorry to take up your time.

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:34.830
Speaking of Sagami-chan,
are you sure this is best for him?

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:38.790
Right now, Sana-chan, you have
no work to speak of, right?

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:42.120
If you keep Sagami-san
restricted like this,

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:46.800
he will be unable to demonstrate himself
as a shrewd manager.

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:48.460
Listen, Sana-chan,

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:53.470
if you join us, Sagami-chan will
be able to work as much as he likes.

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:58.140
Think about what I'm saying,
for Sagami-chan's sake as well.

00:15:58.060 --> 00:15:59.560
"Rei-kun's sake?"

00:15:58.140 --> 00:15:59.680
Really?

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:00.810
I'm home.

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:02.480
Welcome back, Sana.

00:16:02.480 --> 00:16:04.480
Huh? Mama, where's Rei-kun?

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:08.480
Sagami-kun has gone out. He said he was
going to go get some work for you, Sana.

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:11.150
He has, huh?

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:13.110
Kitazawa-san, I'm begging you,

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:15.820
is there some way you can return
Sana-chan to being a regular again?

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:18.490
You shouldn't be asking me,
it's not my decision to make.

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:20.830
Can't you do something? Please!

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:23.170
Sagami-chan, I'm sorry, maybe next time.

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:25.500
One moment, please, Kitazawa-san!

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:27.840
I'm sorry, Sagami-chan,
try asking somewhere else.

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:30.510
Kitazawa-san! Huh?

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:31.760
"Sorry!! Leave."

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:33.380
"A despondent Rei-kun"

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:33.550
Sure enough, there's no work.

00:16:34.090 --> 00:16:39.100
Sana-chan, I'm sorry. I just don't
have enough of what it takes.

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:44.100
Maybe Sana-chan would be happier
joining a big outfit like Drea-Pro.

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:48.230
"I'm a lousy manager"

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:48.360
Rei-kun...

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:53.450
I'm home.

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:56.910
Welcome back! You must be hungry, huh?
Want to have supper?

00:16:56.950 --> 00:16:58.780
Or would you like a bath first?

00:16:58.780 --> 00:17:01.120
Heh, it almost sounds
like we're newlyweds, huh?

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:05.120
Um, Sana-chan, about your work...

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:06.460
Mm-hmm, what?

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:09.460
I don't think we can go on like this.

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:11.130
What do you mean, "like this"?

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:13.800
"Like this" means like this.

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:16.800
Huh? What are you saying?
I don't understand.

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:20.470
There's nothing not to understand!
"Like this" means "like this"!

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:23.480
You haven't given it any serious thought,
have you, Sana-chan?

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:27.400
What are you talking about!? I have
so been thinking about you, Rei-kun!

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:34.440
Sana-chan, think about what I'm saying,
for Sagami-chan's sake as well.

00:17:34.440 --> 00:17:38.450
When he says "like this,"
does he mean like this?

00:17:38.450 --> 00:17:39.780
Rei-kun,

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:43.450
I don't have any work, so I can't
go on employing you, Rei-kun.

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:45.790
I'm sorry, but go work for
yourself somewhere else.

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:49.250
This works out perfectly!
I was just thinking,

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:51.130
I've just about had it with
taking care of you, Sana-chan!

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:53.300
Don't you think you should go join
some production company somewhere

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:54.460
at this point?

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:56.720
I was hoping for this, you pea-brain!

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:59.140
There's no point in us
staying together anymore!

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:03.140
Yeah! It seems longer than it
has been, but I'm in your debt!

00:18:03.140 --> 00:18:06.230
Yeah, yeah, you are in my debt!

00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:09.520
Well, take care.

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:12.820
Oh, my word...

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:15.150
Ah, that's a load off!

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:17.950
Ah, that's a load off.

00:18:21.160 --> 00:18:23.830
His Burutcha...

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:25.450
Rei-kun...

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:28.500
He came back!

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:29.170
Rei-kun?

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:31.420
Aloha, Sana-chan!

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:32.750
Oh, it's just you, Zenjiro-sensei.

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:35.420
Don't "Oh, it's just you" me.
I brought you a gift.

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:37.760
My, thank you for going to the trouble.

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:40.760
Huh? Where's Sagami-chan?

00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:43.100
We've parted ways.

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:44.770
Huh? Pawted ways?

00:18:44.770 --> 00:18:49.770
After all, I don't have any work, so I was
thinking of joining Drea-Pro or somewhere.

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:53.770
No, Sana-chan! If you do that,
they'll have you ovuh a barrel.

00:18:53.770 --> 00:18:55.110
Over a barrel?

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:57.110
That's an octopus pot.

00:18:57.110 --> 00:19:01.780
Awl of this was set up by
Drea-Pro's president and Akudo!

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:04.450
I got the producuh drunk and hoid it
from him myself. There's no doubt about it.

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:07.790
They planned awl sorts of doity tricks
to get your woik to dry up Sana-chan,

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:10.460
so that you would be lured to join
their company! These guys are awful!

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:12.920
What!?

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:14.340
"Taken in"

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:14.460
Ah! She's snapped!

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:18.470
They won't get away with it! If that's how
they want it, I'm going to go pound them!

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:20.470
Sounds like fun. I'll go with you.

00:19:20.470 --> 00:19:21.800
This should be good.

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:25.470
President, are you sure this thing
with Sana-chan is going to work?

00:19:25.470 --> 00:19:30.140
You're such a worrywart. There's no way
my plan can fall through, is there?

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:32.770
I wonder what Sana-chan
is doing right now.

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:33.900
"Under arrest"

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:34.060
I'm right here!

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:38.440
You're under arrest! You're under arrest,
you villains! Don't you see these lanterns!?

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:40.400
Hey, Sana-chan! Glad you came!

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:42.410
You've finally gotten serious
about this, have you?

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:44.450
Silence, you Knucklehead!

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:49.450
How dare you split me and Rei-kun up!
I know what your evil scheme is now!

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:51.790
Now come along quietly!

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:54.460
Hmph! If that's how you want it...

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:56.460
Whoa! That's dangerous, mister!

00:19:56.460 --> 00:19:59.760
Interesting! In that case, for our part...

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:02.220
We've got lots of costumes!

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:06.180
Whoa!

00:20:10.140 --> 00:20:12.140
I caught you!

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:13.100
I'm beaten!

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:15.480
What's a good grown-up
like you talking about?

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:19.150
Now, for the evil magistrate,
Yumezono Matata-ta-ta-ta-ta!

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:21.820
You tell 'im, Sana-chan!

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:25.120
You used dirty tricks
to divide me and Rei-kun,

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:30.120
and schemed to get me to join Drea-Pro,
Yumezono-san! You're not even human!

00:20:32.410 --> 00:20:37.090
I have no intention of
ever joining your outfit!

00:20:37.090 --> 00:20:38.750
You're weak, Zenjiro-chan.

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:42.420
Oh yeah? Fine. If that's how
strongly you feel, I give up.

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:45.090
Really? That was pretty easy.

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:48.430
I did it! Now that that's settled,
I've got no more business with you.

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:49.430
Shall we go home?

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:50.430
Yeah, okay, Sana-chan.

00:20:50.430 --> 00:20:52.770
See you later, fellas!

00:20:52.770 --> 00:20:55.100
Okay, thanks. Carry on.

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:57.770
You're Zenjiro, aren't you?

00:20:57.770 --> 00:21:00.440
N- no, I'm not!
You're mistaking me for someone else!

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:03.450
Well, goodbye!

00:21:03.450 --> 00:21:05.780
Sana-chan,

00:21:05.780 --> 00:21:11.200
you're going to find out what
happens to those who defy me.

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:18.460
This week's Sana-chan, sheriff style.

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:20.500
Sana-chan...

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:24.470
Sana-chan... Sana-chan...

00:21:24.470 --> 00:21:26.130
Rei-kun...

00:21:26.130 --> 00:21:28.140
Sana-chan...

00:21:28.140 --> 00:21:30.810
Zenjiro-san told me everything.

00:21:30.810 --> 00:21:33.810
I'm not going to join Drea-Pro.

00:21:33.810 --> 00:21:38.650
No matter how much they obstruct me
from here on, I won't be beaten by them.

00:21:44.820 --> 00:21:48.160
Okay? Let's go home together, Rei-kun.

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:50.240
Sana-chan...

00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:53.500
Huh? You got me a job!?

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:55.080
That's right!

00:21:57.500 --> 00:22:01.090
It's just a small bit part
in a late-night drama,

00:22:01.090 --> 00:22:02.170
but Tsu-san is giving it to you.

00:22:02.170 --> 00:22:04.510
Tsu-san is a great guy!

00:22:04.510 --> 00:22:06.840
--Thank you very much, Tsu-san!
--Thank you very much, Tsu-san!

00:22:06.840 --> 00:22:08.510
--We love you!
--We love you!

00:22:08.510 --> 00:22:11.260
Aw, never mind that,
let me introduce the man

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:12.850
who will be playing
the role of Sana-chan's father,

00:22:12.850 --> 00:22:15.850
Gojo Takeshi-san.

00:22:15.850 --> 00:22:18.520
Nice to meet you.

00:22:18.520 --> 00:22:21.270
I'm Gojo. It's a pleasure.

00:22:25.860 --> 00:22:28.200
The moment I saw that man,

00:22:28.200 --> 00:22:30.870
for some reason,

00:22:30.870 --> 00:22:34.120
I felt a sense of familiarity
within my heart.

00:22:35.790 --> 00:22:38.080
It's all DAIJO-BU DAIJO-BU

00:22:38.160 --> 00:22:40.880
When you sing this song, your worries will go

00:22:41.040 --> 00:22:43.000
Bye Bye Bye

00:22:43.340 --> 00:22:45.670
Cuz your heart will be carefree,

00:22:45.840 --> 00:22:47.630
and your body will be healthy,

00:22:47.720 --> 00:22:49.470
so resolve when to give up

00:22:49.630 --> 00:22:51.430
Bye Bye Bye Bye

00:22:51.470 --> 00:22:52.800
(Sing-ken-ken ken-ken)

00:22:52.800 --> 00:22:54.470
(Tidak apa-apa,
Nday kambay kambay)

00:22:54.640 --> 00:22:57.100
It's always the same old nonsense,

00:22:57.230 --> 00:22:59.560
U-MAI U-MAI U-MAI U-MAI U-MAI

00:22:59.560 --> 00:23:02.060
(Mm? Could be you're fairly dumb...)

00:23:02.110 --> 00:23:04.730
and then later comes the whimpering,

00:23:04.860 --> 00:23:06.570
KU-RAI KU-RAI KU-RAI KU-RAI KU-RAI

00:23:07.320 --> 00:23:10.030
(Ah... it's fine, it's fine, it's fine)

00:23:10.070 --> 00:23:12.370
It's all crazy over there,

00:23:12.530 --> 00:23:14.280
it's all "waah!" over here,

00:23:14.410 --> 00:23:17.620
and the whole Earth
is spinning the wrong way.

00:23:17.750 --> 00:23:21.460
So at this point now, yeah at this point now,

00:23:21.580 --> 00:23:25.750
you can laugh it away, excuse me, I must be going.

00:23:25.800 --> 00:23:27.670
DAIJO-BU DAIJO-BU

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:30.510
When you sing this song, your worries will go

00:23:30.630 --> 00:23:32.430
Bye Bye Bye

00:23:32.800 --> 00:23:35.310
Cuz you tried your MECHA-KUCHA best,

00:23:35.430 --> 00:23:37.180
to PECHA-KUCHA out a "Hi,"

00:23:37.310 --> 00:23:39.100
so just keep going unlike this!

00:23:39.230 --> 00:23:41.020
Wai Wai Wai Wai

00:23:41.190 --> 00:23:42.900
DAIJO-BU DAIJO-BU

00:23:43.020 --> 00:23:47.820
Once your lips touch, you can't change your mind.

00:23:48.230 --> 00:23:50.490
Cuz your heart will be carefree,

00:23:50.650 --> 00:23:52.410
and your body will be healthy,

00:23:52.570 --> 00:23:54.370
so resolve when to give up

00:23:54.490 --> 00:23:57.950
Bye Bye Bye Bye

00:23:57.990 --> 00:24:00.160
(Sing-ken-ken ken-ken,
Tidak apa-apa)

00:24:00.210 --> 00:24:02.170
(Gwaenchansseumnida,
kwenchanayo)

00:24:02.250 --> 00:24:03.540
(Mou man tail)

00:24:07.630 --> 00:24:10.300
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:10.300 --> 00:24:12.970
Yeah, I finally found some work!

00:24:12.970 --> 00:24:14.970
Or so I thought,
and then I found out

00:24:14.970 --> 00:24:16.640
that it's a drama on at 3:00 in the morning
that no one will see.

00:24:16.640 --> 00:24:17.930
Still, Rei-kun worked so hard
to find me this job,

00:24:17.930 --> 00:24:20.060
so Kurata Sana will pitch
as hard as she can! Though you know,

00:24:20.060 --> 00:24:22.980
Gojo Takeshi-san, the man
who plays my father, is kind of a crazy guy.

00:24:22.980 --> 00:24:24.650
Who is he exactly?

00:24:24.650 --> 00:24:26.900
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha,
Episode 42,

00:24:26.900 --> 00:24:28.650
a tale of "oops,
I forgot to write my essay!"

00:24:28.650 --> 00:24:32.990
The Delirious Nick-of-Time Deadline

00:24:32.990 --> 00:24:35.620
You shouldn't push yourself too hard.
You'll ruin your health.
